---

<section
	class="flex min-h-[90vh] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6 px-6 py-24 text-center sm:px-8"
>
	<p
		class="font-sans text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-accent-text)] uppercase sm:text-sm"
	>
		Ijāzah Certification
	</p>

	<h1
		class="max-w-3xl font-serif text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)] font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)]"
	>
		The Foundational Knowledge Certification
	</h1>

	<p class="max-w-xl text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
		Get certified by top scholars in the foundational text of Mālikī fiqh — rigorous examination,
		traditional transmission, lasting recognition.
	</p>

	<div class="my-2 flex items-center gap-3" aria-hidden="true">
		<span class="h-px w-10 bg-[var(--color-border)] sm:w-16"></span>
		<span class="h-2 w-2 rotate-45 bg-[var(--color-accent)]"></span>
		<span class="h-px w-10 bg-[var(--color-border)] sm:w-16"></span>
	</div>

	<div class="font-serif text-base text-[var(--color-primary)] sm:text-lg">
		Al-Murshid al-Mu'īn
	</div>
	<p class="-mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">by Ibn ʿĀshir</p>

	<a
		href="#signup"
		class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)] px-8 py-3 font-sans text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-bg)] transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-[var(--color-primary-light)]"
	>
		Sign Up
	</a>
</section>
